          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>\"REMOVES ALL PLAQUE EVEN THOSE WHICH SEEM VERY DIFFICULT. SAVES TRIPS TO THE DENTIST ALL AT THE COMFORT OF YOUR OWN HOME\"<\/p>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
